{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31340","headline":"宿日观东房诗 · 李质","name":"宿日观东房诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾入桃溪路，仙源信少双。\n洞霞飘素练，藓壁画阴窗。\n古木愁撑月，危峰欲堕江。\n自吟空向寂，谁共倒秋缸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李质","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}